@org=$C000
@expand=#DEF1(#MESSAGE(addr)#STR{addr},$08($b==$5E||$b==$7E))

; Location Text
;
; Plain-text descriptions for rooms below #N($66), paged in at #N$C000
; while a room is described. Each description terminates with #N$7E.
; .
; It opens with the legendary: "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
@label=LocationText
t$C000 DEFM "welcome to Blizzard Pass by Alan Cox. This program is dedicated t" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C041 DEFM "o Hawkwind. Any resemblance between the characters in the game an" ;
 $C082 DEFM "d your mother in law is total coincidence"                         ; }
 $C0AB DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C0AC DEFM "you are trudging through deep snow as you follow a narrow track t" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C0ED DEFM "hat winds down a long pass leading ever southwards, it's end is h" ;
 $C12E DEFM "idden by the flurries of snow that are still falling. Either side" ;
 $C16F DEFM " of you the mountains tower above the pass, with the high peaks v" ;
 $C1B0 DEFM "eiled in cloud. At one point however the cliff is nowhere near as" ;
 $C1F1 DEFM " steep and a fair way up a single window is cut into the cliff, l" ;
 $C232 DEFM "ooking out across the snows"                                       ; }
 $C24D DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C24E DEFM "you are lost in a blizzard, almost blinded by the driving snows. " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C28F DEFM "The howling icy wind sends huge clouds of snow whistling across t" ;
 $C2D0 DEFM "he plain totally obscuring your view"                              ; }
 $C2F4 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C2F5 DEFM "you are hanging onto a fairly precipitous cliff, beside a rocky w" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C336 DEFM "indow. Far below you can see the pass which seems to sway backwar" ;
 $C377 DEFM "ds and forwards as the icy wind tries to tear you away from the c" ;
 $C3B8 DEFM "liff and lashes you with huge clouds of blinding snow. "           ; }
 $C3EF DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C3F0 DEFM "you are in a small stonewalled chamber. Light streams in through " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C431 DEFM "a somewhat vandalised window, to the north is another darker cham" ;
 $C472 DEFM "ber only partially lit from the window, while to the south throug" ;
 $C4B3 DEFM "h a doorway cloaked in deep shadow you can see a dark passage"     ; }
 $C4F0 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C4F1 DEFM "you are in a dark gloomy room, light from the window to the south" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C532 DEFM " dimly illuminates one wall. To the south is another much brighte" ;
 $C573 DEFM "r chamber"                                                         ; }
 $C57C DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C57D DEFM "empty"                                                             ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C582 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C583 DEFM "you are following a dark passage which leads north into a brighty" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C5C4 DEFM " lit room and south towards a T junction. The thick dust on the f" ;
 $C605 DEFM "loor shows that you are the only person to have come this way for" ;
 $C646 DEFM " a long time"                                                      ; }
 $C652 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C653 DEFM "you are walking along a long and fairly wide stonewalled passage " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C694 DEFM "leading east and west through the mountain. To the north through " ;
 $C6D5 DEFM "a doorway the feeble light of the rock reveals a small room"       ; }
 $C710 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C711 DEFM "empty"                                                             ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C716 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C717 DEFM "you are in a low secret passage that leads southwards to some kin" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C758 DEFM "d of dark pillared room. The north wall has niches cut into it to" ;
 $C799 DEFM " allow you to climb through the hole in the roof which leads up p" ;
 $C7DA DEFM "ast the statue"                                                    ; }
 $C7E8 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C7E9 DEFM "you are in a dark rather gloomy temple. Huge pillars hold up the " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C82A DEFM "roof of this vast chamber and cast strange shadows that seem to d" ;
 $C86B DEFM "ance around you as you move around. The centre of the temple is a" ;
 $C8AC DEFM " flat platform with a now broken altar as it's centrepiece"        ; }
 $C8E6 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C8E7 DEFM "you are in a large dark room, passages lead east and west. A set " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C928 DEFM "of crumbling stone steps leads steeply downwards plunging into th" ;
 $C969 DEFM "e shadows"                                                         ; }
 $C972 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $C973 DEFM "you are in a short section of east west corridor. To the west the" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $C9B4 DEFM " corridor leads to a huge hall, while to the north through a door" ;
 $C9F5 DEFM "way is a small dimly lit room"                                     ; }
 $CA12 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CA13 DEFM "you are in a small rather dirty room which appears to have been a" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CA54 DEFM " store room of some kind. Through a doorway to the south is a cor" ;
 $CA95 DEFM "ridor"                                                             ; }
 $CA9A DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CA9B DEFM "you are in a huge pillared hall deep within the mountain. Huge or" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CADC DEFM "nately carved pillars support the millions of tons of rock above " ;
 $CB1D DEFM "me. Sinister and rather ugly gargoyles protrude from the pillars " ;
 $CB5E DEFM "gazing centrally towards a mass of mystical symbols which are eng" ;
 $CB9F DEFM "raved all over the floor"                                          ; }
 $CBB7 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CBB8 DEFM "you are on a landing with steep stairs leading both upwards and d" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CBF9 DEFM "own. Below at the foot of the descending stairs you can see a dar" ;
 $CC3A DEFM "k hall and in the faint light from the rock you can just make out" ;
 $CC7B DEFM " several zombie guards"                                            ; }
 $CC91 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CC92 DEFM "you are in a shattered hall. Huge scorch marks and strange burns " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CCD3 DEFM "appear to indicate a tremendous amount of powerful sorcery was us" ;
 $CD14 DEFM "ed in here, indeed sufficient to blow huge chunks out of the wall" ; }
 $CD55 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CD56 DEFM "you are in a low narrow corridor. To the south is a small chamber" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CD97 DEFM " while to the east the passage opens up into a large cave"         ; }
 $CDD0 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CDD1 DEFM "you are in what appears to have been a large rest chamber of some" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CE12 DEFM " sort. There is a great deal of dried blood on the floor here, an" ;
 $CE53 DEFM "d several more marks that seem to indicate the use of sorcery"     ; }
 $CE90 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CE91 DEFM "you are in a dark cave with earth walls and a rather low ceiling." ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CED2 DEFM " The earth gives way to stone in both of the passages leading out" ;
 $CF13 DEFM " of the cave"                                                      ; }
 $CF1F DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CF20 DEFM "you are in a shadowy east west corridor that links two caves"      ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CF5C DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $CF5D DEFM "you are in a beautiful limestone cave. Multi coloured stalactites" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $CF9E DEFM " hang from the roof forming amazing patterns of brilliant colour." ;
 $CFDF DEFM " The floor is similarly decorated with a huge variety of stalagmi" ;
 $D020 DEFM "tes"                                                               ; }
 $D023 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D024 DEFM "you are in an old laboratory for sorcerous experiments.Almost eve" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D065 DEFM "rything to indicate this has been taken leaving only marks in the" ;
 $D0A6 DEFM " dust"                                                             ; }
 $D0AB DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D0AC DEFM "you are in a low passageway. Mould covers the walls and floor, ma" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D0ED DEFM "king it slippery and quite treacherous. To the north is a beautif" ;
 $D12E DEFM "ul cave while to the south the mould seems to get even thicker"    ; }
 $D16C DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D16D DEFM "you are in a dark chamber, which smells of old blood and rotting " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D1AE DEFM "flesh. Marks on the floor reveal where old torture equipment one " ;
 $D1EF DEFM "stood"                                                             ; }
 $D1F4 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D1F5 DEFM "you are in a low arched dungeon corridor. The air is dank and mus" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D236 DEFM "ty and an air of gloom and evil hangs around it. Rooms to the sou" ;
 $D277 DEFM "th and west appear equally unpleasant and sinister. A dark passag" ;
 $D2B8 DEFM "eway leads northwards "                                            ; }
 $D2CE DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D2CF DEFM "you are in a large messy chamber. Several wooden gallows are set " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D310 DEFM "across the damp ceiling and beneath them pools of blood indicate " ;
 $D351 DEFM "they were not merely decorations. A low archway leads out into an" ;
 $D392 DEFM " unpleasant looking corridor "                                     ; }
 $D3AF DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D3B0 DEFM "you are in a cold and bare stone cell, scratches on the walls mar" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D3F1 DEFM "k where prisoners have left their last futile marks on the walls " ; }
 $D432 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D433 DEFM "you are in a small robing room which appears to have been unused " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D474 DEFM "for quite a while. To the south a dark corridor leads east and we" ;
 $D4B5 DEFM "st into darkness"                                                  ; }
 $D4C5 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D4C6 DEFM "you are in a charnel smelling crypt. Dark drapes hang between the" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D507 DEFM " pillars that make up the walls. The whole room has an atmosphere" ;
 $D548 DEFM " of waiting malignant evil and an oppressive silence that makes y" ;
 $D589 DEFM "ou jump at the slightest draught in the still, cold air"           ; }
 $D5C0 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D5C1 DEFM "you are in a small chamber with two high arched exits leading nor" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D602 DEFM "th and south"                                                      ; }
 $D60E DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D60F DEFM "you are in a dusty bare library. Hundreds of worm eaten bookcases" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D650 DEFM " stand devoid of all books, their shelves laden only with dust. A" ;
 $D691 DEFM " high archway leads out"                                           ; }
 $D6A8 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D6A9 DEFM "you are in a large cavern. Huge stalgmites have grown up almost t" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D6EA DEFM "o the ceiling, in places actually merging with the multicoloured " ;
 $D72B DEFM "stalactites above. A small low walled well occupies the centre of" ;
 $D76C DEFM " the cave "                                                        ; }
 $D776 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D777 DEFM "you are standing at the bottom of a small dried up well. The wall" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D7B8 DEFM "s are (fortunately) rough enough to make climbing out only slight" ;
 $D7F9 DEFM "ly harder than falling in "                                        ; }
 $D813 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D814 DEFM "you are in a massive pillared hall decorated with the shields of " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D855 DEFM "ancient and long forgotten heroes. Exits between the pillars lead" ;
 $D896 DEFM " into several different caves "                                    ; }
 $D8B4 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $D8B5 DEFM "you are in a huge cavern. The walls glow and pulse with an intens" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $D8F6 DEFM "e red light, reflected up from a river of lava which flows sluggi" ;
 $D937 DEFM "shly westwards at the south end of the cavern. Huge explosions of" ;
 $D978 DEFM " lava regularly light up the cavern to an extent that the light i" ;
 $D9B9 DEFM "s almost blinding, accompanied by almost deafening explosions. A " ;
 $D9FA DEFM "path leads down almost suicidally close to the lava river"         ; }
 $DA33 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DA34 DEFM "you are in the musty chamber concealed down the well. The chamber" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DA75 DEFM " is cold and damp, perhaps as a result of this"                    ; }
 $DAA3 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DAA4 DEFM "you are in a big cave. The rough rocky walls are inscribed with d" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DAE5 DEFM "eep angular runic writings, which appear totally incomprehensible" ;
 $DB26 DEFM " to you"                                                           ; }
 $DB2D DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DB2E DEFM "you are on a narrow sloping path running uncomfortably close to t" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DB6F DEFM "he lava. Huge explosions of lava send blasts of intense scorching" ;
 $DBB0 DEFM " heat across the path. The path leads eastwards but the intense r" ;
 $DBF1 DEFM "ed glow and heat haze prevents you from seeing where to"           ; }
 $DC28 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DC29 DEFM "you are at the end of the path. The lava is some distance away fr" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DC6A DEFM "om you here but even so the intense red glow still lights up the " ;
 $DCAB DEFM "chamber and the heat is scarcely bearable"                         ; }
 $DCD4 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DCD5 DEFM "you are on a ledge in a huge fissure. The fissure is so wide that" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DD16 DEFM " the far wall is hidden in darkness. Looking down (a rather bad i" ;
 $DD57 DEFM "dea) you can see that it is just about possible to climb the horr" ;
 $DD98 DEFM "endous distance down to the floor of the fissure"                  ; }
 $DDC8 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DDC9 DEFM "you are at the bottom of the fissure. Precipitous rocky walls rea" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DE0A DEFM "ch upwards hanging over you as if about to crush you. The walls v" ;
 $DE4B DEFM "anish beyond your light without any sign of a break"               ; }
 $DE7E DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DE7F DEFM "you are in a narrow crack, off one side of the fissure. The walls" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DEC0 DEFM " lean in at crazy angles making it hard to get through "           ; }
 $DEF7 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DEF8 DEFM "you are in an ornate gallery which overlooks a wide stone guardro" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DF39 DEFM "om. A set of steps curve steeply down into the guardroom. A hole " ;
 $DF7A DEFM "in one wall leads back to the fissure "                            ; }
 $DFA0 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $DFA1 DEFM "you are in a large guardroom. A set of stone steps curve steeply " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $DFE2 DEFM "up to a gallery above. To the west is another guardroom although " ;
 $E023 DEFM "your dim light reveals the presence of some zombie warriors"       ; }
 $E05E DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E05F DEFM "you are in a large guardroom. A set of stairs leads up and down. " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E0A0 DEFM "To the east you can see a large guardroom while to the south you " ;
 $E0E1 DEFM "can see what appears to be a large lake"                           ; }
 $E108 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E109 DEFM "you are in a wide passageway. To the east is a cave lit by a flic" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E14A DEFM "kering red glow. To the north is a large cave. To the west is a g" ;
 $E18B DEFM "uardroom"                                                          ; }
 $E193 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E194 DEFM "you are in a fissure standing on a terrifyingly narrow ledge. Abo" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E1D5 DEFM "ve you on the opposite side is another ledge "                     ; }
 $E202 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E203 DEFM "you are in a huge cavern, at the western end. Some steep rough-he" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E244 DEFM "wn steps lead down into a canyon at one end of the cave and at th" ;
 $E285 DEFM "e bottom faint light flickers off water"                           ; }
 $E2AC DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E2AD DEFM "you are in a large rocky and very uneven cave. A smooth path has " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E2EE DEFM "been cut across the floor permitting easy walking. The whole cave" ;
 $E32F DEFM " is filled with a thundering roar which reaches deep into your mi" ;
 $E370 DEFM "nd. A huge, deep and steep walled channel "                        ; }
 $E39A DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E39B DEFM "you are in a large rocky cavern. From this vantage point at the e" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E3DC DEFM "astern end you can gaze almost the full length of the cave, altho" ;
 $E41D DEFM "ugh the far wall fades into shadows"                               ; }
 $E440 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E441 DEFM "you are in the hall of fire. The very walls are tinged with a fie" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E482 DEFM "ry radiance, as if the rock itself is burning. A red pentacle is " ;
 $E4C3 DEFM "near one wall beside a picture carved in the wall. A lever on one" ;
 $E504 DEFM " wall is beside a huge metal drawbridge that is "                  ; }
 $E534 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E535 DEFM "you are at the bottom of a narrow canyon looking across a stream " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E576 DEFM "to the far bank. Narrow steps wind steeply upwards behind you"     ; }
 $E5B3 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E5B4 DEFM "you are in a rocky canyon beside a deep blue stream. A narrow cra" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E5F5 DEFM "ck leads eastwards into a gloomy shadowed cave"                    ; }
 $E623 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E624 DEFM "you are on a wide ledge looking down on a pool of bubbling lava b" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E665 DEFM "elow. There is another ledge on the other side "                   ; }
 $E694 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E695 DEFM "you are in a large cave. The cave echoes to the dripping of water" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E6D6 DEFM " from its cold damp roof, thickly coated in algae and mosses"      ; }
 $E712 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E713 DEFM "you are in a ornate pillared hall. The stunning fan vaulted roof " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E754 DEFM "would decorate any catherdral as would the huge pillars that supp" ;
 $E795 DEFM "ort it"                                                            ; }
 $E79B DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E79C DEFM "you are in a magnificent throne hall. The walls and roof are carv" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E7DD DEFM "ed and painted into stunning otherworldy scenes of mystical beast" ;
 $E81E DEFM "s and magical forms. Dark curtains cover the walls"                ; }
 $E850 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E851 DEFM "you are in a small stonewalled room with a"                        ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E87B DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E87C DEFM "you are in a treasure storage room. The high ceiling ensures that" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E8BD DEFM " no thief will ever escape without help. There is a broken grille" ;
 $E8FE DEFM " in the ceiling, far beyond your despairing reach"                 ; }
 $E92F DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $E930 DEFM "you are in a low rough passage which winds around and is clearly " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $E971 DEFM "only an escape route of some form. A crude sign hanging on the wa" ;
 $E9B2 DEFM "ll reads in a rather crude and untidy hand 'DANGER STORM GIANTS C" ;
 $E9F3 DEFM "AN SERIOUSLY DAMAGE YOUR ELF"                                      ; }
 $EA0F DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EA10 DEFM "you are in a huge glittering cave. Millions of tiny crystals on t" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EA51 DEFM "he wall scintilate with rainbows of colours baffling your eyes an" ;
 $EA92 DEFM "d mind with a stunning mass of changing colour. A set of huge ste" ;
 $EAD3 DEFM "ps lead upwards out of the cave but only a giant could hope to cl" ;
 $EB14 DEFM "imb them "                                                         ; }
 $EB1D DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EB1E DEFM "you are in the smelly pit which once contained the slime. The hor" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EB5F DEFM "rible charnel rotting smell is so strong that you can scarcely ke" ;
 $EBA0 DEFM "ep your stomach under control "                                    ; }
 $EBBE DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EBBF DEFM "you have ceased to exist"                                          ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EBD7 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EBD8 DEFM "you are on a ledge looking across a huge pit of flaming lava to a" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EC19 DEFM "nother ledge on the other side"                                    ; }
 $EC37 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EC38 DEFM "you are in a sinister temple. Hideous shapes seem to reach out of" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EC79 DEFM " nothingness towards you and vanish as immaterial shadows. The wh" ;
 $ECBA DEFM "ole room radiates a crushing sense of power filling you with awe " ;
 $ECFB DEFM "and dread. A huge fire burns at an end of the temple, seemingly w" ;
 $ED3C DEFM "ithout a source"                                                   ; }
 $ED4B DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $ED4C DEFM "you are standing in a circular workroom. The only exit is a doorw" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $ED8D DEFM "ay, through which the temple fire casts its flickering glow acros" ;
 $EDCE DEFM "s the room"                                                        ; }
 $EDD8 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EDD9 DEFM "you are outside The Gate Of Sorcerors. It's mighty pillars tower " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EE1A DEFM "up between you, shielding you from the worst of the snow that is " ;
 $EE5B DEFM "falling and from some of the icy winds. The ancient arched gatewa" ;
 $EE9C DEFM "y between the pillars is barred by a huge portcullis"              ; }
 $EED0 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EED1 DEFM "you are standing on the edge of a deep crevasse looking down into" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EF12 DEFM " darkness. Heavy snow is falling all around you partially hiding " ;
 $EF53 DEFM "the distant mountains in clouds of whiteness"                      ; }
 $EF7F DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $EF80 DEFM "you are at the bottom of the crevasse. Daylight, and a great deal" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $EFC1 DEFM " of snow, comes through the top of the crevasse. A single man mad" ;
 $F002 DEFM "e passage leads east into a strange temple"                        ; }
 $F02C DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F02D DEFM "you are in the temple of the elements surrounded by decorations d" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F06E DEFM "epicting earth, air, fire and water in balance. This strange icy " ;
 $F0AF DEFM "place gives off a feeling of unbalance and growing evil"           ; }
 $F0E6 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F0E7 DEFM "empty"                                                             ; "#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F0EC DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F0ED DEFM "you are in a glittering ice cave. The floor is covered in deep sn" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F12E DEFM "ow. The cavemouth is blocked by snow from the avalanche"           ; }
 $F165 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F166 DEFM "you are walking down the pass as it runs north south through the " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F1A7 DEFM "mountains. There is a small cavemouth here"                        ; }
 $F1D1 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F1D2 DEFM "you are trudging along a gloomy narrow pass pelted with snow whil" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F213 DEFM "e the icy wind feels like daggers stabbing into your unprotected " ;
 $F254 DEFM "flesh "                                                            ; }
 $F25A DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F25B DEFM "you are trudging along the pass. The wind here whips around in a " ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F29C DEFM "circular pattern almost veiling a narrow ravine leading eastwards" ;
 $F2DD DEFM " "                                                                 ; }
 $F2DE DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F2DF DEFM "you are on a path climbing up a narrow ravine towards the crumbli" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F320 DEFM "ng remains of a snow shrouded temple"                              ; }
 $F344 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F345 DEFM "you are in the snowy ruins of an ancient temple. The view from he" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F386 DEFM "re is stunning and very picturesque but the lashing snow and icy " ;
 $F3C7 DEFM "wind are enough to persuade you from some sightseeing"             ; }
 $F3FC DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F3FD DEFM "you are trudging down the pass. The towering mountains, their hea" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F43E DEFM "ds cloaked in snow seem to leer down on you as your feet crunch i" ;
 $F47F DEFM "nto the fresh, deep and rather cold snow "                         ; }
 $F4A8 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F4A9 DEFM "you are at the southern end of the pass. The snow gives way rapid" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F4EA DEFM "ly to a pleasant autumn sun, its gentle beams filling the whole v" ;
 $F52B DEFM "ista with a shimmering beautiful golden hue "                      ; }
 $F557 DEFB $7E                                                                 ; Terminator.
 $F558 DEFM "you are in a green and fair valley amidst the gently murmuring oa" ; {"#MESSAGE(#PC)".
 $F599 DEFM "ks. The sun shines gently through the trees sending dancing golde" ;
